          <!--   <p class="blog-post-meta">October 13, 2022 by <a href="#">Eric M. M.</a></p> -->
    
            <p>Click the login button to register yourself as a business or customer, then populate your site with items in case you are a business or else request an item as a newly registered or regular customer. </p>
