              <li>If the business is yours this part in the link ?business=yourbusiness has yourbusiness corresponding to your username .</li>
              <li>Access your items using this link https://deliva.stratetactical.com?business=mybusinessname , don't forget to replace mybusinessname with your real business name.</li>
              <li>Request items as a newly registered or regular customer.</li>
              <li>You will see this page if your business does not have any items or mybusinessname is invalid.</li>
              <li>We recommend that you only utilize the navigation arrows provided by the application a good example is the back arrows in the app pages.</li>
              <li>This application does not make use of cookies.</li>
              <li>We hope you have mastered the art, now it's time to go ${myhelp2} </li>
